{
  "scenarioVersion": 1,
  "name": "channel",
  "description": "Choosing the channel. A name Twitch could not have keeps \"Join chat\" off and Enter joins nothing; the field takes 26 characters; a name is joined as Twitch writes it, without its # and in lower case, by Enter or by the button; a favorite's chip joins it; \"Change channel\" opens the selector over the chat, which stays until the new channel is joined, and closes it; \"Disconnect channel\" leaves. Each is one call, and the channel shown is the one OverCrow announces.",
